### ============================================
### hr-security 接口测试文件（IDEA 内置 HTTP Client）
### 用法：确保应用已启动，然后逐个点左侧绿色箭头运行
### 顺序：先跑 1-2 登录拿 token（会自动存为全局变量），再跑后续用例
### ============================================

### ---------- 1. 认证 ----------

### 1.1 注册普通用户（密码以 BCrypt 密文落库，默认分配 EMPLOYEE 角色）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "张三"
}

### 1.2 admin 登录（种子账号，角色 ADMIN），token 存 {{adminToken}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1.3 普通用户登录（角色 EMPLOYEE），token 存 {{empToken}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("empToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1.4 获取当前用户（登录响应与 /me 均带 roles）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------- 2. 部门管理 ----------

### 2.1 部门列表（登录即可查看）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/depts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.2 新增部门（仅 ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/depts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptName": "测试部",
  "sort": 9
}

### 2.3 修改部门（仅 ADMIN），{id} 替换为 2.2 返回的 id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/depts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptName": "测试研发部",
  "sort": 8
}

### 2.4 删除空部门（仅 ADMIN），{id} 替换为 2.2 返回的 id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/depts/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.5 权限测试：EMPLOYEE 删除部门 → 403
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/depts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{empToken}}

### ---------- 3. 员工管理 ----------

### 3.1 员工分页列表（keyword 模糊匹配姓名/工号，deptId 可选过滤）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=1&size=10&keyword=张
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.2 员工详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.3 新增员工（仅 ADMIN；工号重复返回 409）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empNo": "E100",
  "name": "测试员工",
  "gender": 1,
  "phone": "13900000000",
  "email": "test@hr.com",
  "deptId": 1,
  "entryDate": "2025-05-01"
}

### 3.4 修改员工（仅 ADMIN），{id} 替换为 3.3 返回的 id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empNo": "E100",
  "name": "测试员工改",
  "gender": 2,
  "deptId": 2
}

### 3.5 删除员工（仅 ADMIN，逻辑删除 = 离职），{id} 替换为 3.3 返回的 id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.6 权限测试：EMPLOYEE 新增员工 → 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{empToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empNo": "E200",
  "name": "越权员工",
  "deptId": 1
}

### ---------- 4. 异常场景 ----------

### 4.1 无 token 访问受保护接口 → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/depts

### 4.2 密码错误登录 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### ---------- 5. Redis 会话与登出（第 3 周新增） ----------

### 5.1 登出（删除 Redis 会话 login:token:{token}，旧 token 立即失效）
### 注意：跑完 5.1 后 adminToken 就失效了，务必接着跑 5.3 重新登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5.2 登出后旧 token 访问 /me → 401（登出即失效，无需等 JWT 过期）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5.3 重新登录刷新 adminToken（登出后恢复会话）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}
